flowchart LR
    Customer[Customer: guest access] -->|booking; design input; image consent; final-price consent| MOH[Mland Operations Hub]
    MOH -->|availability; estimate; feasibility/order result; tracking code| Customer
    Staff[Shop staff or consultant] -->|manage sessions; consult; review or override; fulfilment; manual payment record| MOH
    Owner[Owner or manager] -->|manage catalogue prices; feasibility rules; audit review| MOH
    MOH -->|consented reference image| Vision[AI Vision API: provider TBD]
    Vision -->|quality and candidate ring features| MOH
    MOH -->|booking; review; order notification| Email[Email delivery service: provider TBD]
    MOH -->|payment request; order/deposit amount| Payment[Payment Gateway]
    Payment -->|payment status; transaction ID| MOH
